# More rhwp layout fixes for why-hwp, measured against Hangul 2024 output.
# Base: rhwp 7213ed1f9 after the source edits in wasm/patch-rhwp.sh and
# wasm/patches/rhwp-layout.patch; apply this after rhwp-layout.patch.
# Zero-context diff (apply with git apply --unidiff-zero).
#
# - serializer/hwpx/mod.rs: an HWP5 document's print settings (DOC_DATA) go to
#   settings.xml PrintInfo when converting to hwpx, so Hangul keeps 2-up printing.
# - layout.rs: a paragraph-anchored table in a host paragraph that holds only
#   spaces sits at the paragraph top when the stored line positions show the
#   space line was pushed below it.
# - font_metrics_overlays.rs: bold HCI Poppy U+00B7 advances 384/1000 em like
#   the regular face; Wingdings U+F0FC advances 1609/2048 em.
# - composer/punctuation_slots.rs: a stored Latin run is split at a neutral space
#   so that space advances with the Hangul em and ratio.
# - svg.rs: the hidden text drawn over a vector U+00B7 carries the run's font-family.
# - composer/tests.rs, layout/tests.rs, layout/text_measurement.rs,
#   font_metrics_data.rs and svg/tests.rs cover these changes.
